n remains LEVEL 1 record-level only","intentional evidence-gated deferral is not implementation failure"]},"predecessor_integrity":{"append_only":true,"mechanism":"the correction cites each superseded disposition and each superseded downstream handoff by exact path, JSON pointer, and SHA-256 of the sealed S1.P05.S08 decision and restates them under S1.P05.S08.C01 identifiers; the three predecessor handoffs are superseded in full so a replay has one deterministic effective set; no predecessor byte is edited and the predecessor digest is unchanged","predecessor_artifact_regenerated":false,"predecessor_statements_remain_historically_correct":true},"scope":{"append_only":true,"non_goals":["S1.P05.S09_implementation","S1.P05.S10_implementation","S1.P06_eligibility","migration","persistence","production_semantics_change","public_API_expansion"],"production_modules":[],"roadmap_change":"records the correction and preserves S1.P05.S09 as next and not started"},"source_locks":{"cited_artifacts":[{"byte_length":36563,"git_blob_sha1":"7be417463da4e87f96c38dffea6b3d744515f5fa","lock_id":"decision:s1-p05-s08","mode":"100644","path":"reference_corpus/contracts/development-history/decisions/s08-deferred-subject-disposition/decision.json","role":"corrected_predecessor_decision","sha256":"8df7a989ef33fb5d6e70c8815d1b74748c8c2f98cfb7e581414548a403d65cfe"},{"byte_length":51268,"git_blob_sha1":"7b2f8b0f748ae8bad40ab011487f4dc1e5791466","lock_id":"closure:s1-p04","mode":"100644","path":"reference_corpus/contracts/repository-snapshot/closures/s1-p04-phase-closure/closure.json","role":"separate_subject_ownership_source","sha256":"8605fdd7972f18c0e9c85f26cb0c366e71362630f25ea87a4cd6c22cc85aee74"},{"byte_length":61283,"git_blob_sha1":"058d97118bb94b1d8569c8df82806e18b8aa3fb1","lock_id":"acquisition:pytest-4412-run-0001","mode":"100644","path":"reference_corpus/pytest-4412/acquisitions/run-0001-s04-v1-base-4c9cde74-head-690a63b9/acquisition.json","role":"retained_evidence_source","sha256":"1c29093bf1537e9b824a18df1848b71a8da014f544bc9f385707eb0e000a1318"}],"count":3,"immutable":true},"superseded_dispositions":{"count":6,"items":[{"corrected":{"current_state":"unknown_pending_additional_evidence","disposition":"carried_forward","immediate_owner":"S2","preserved_long_term_owner":"S5"},"correction_id":"correction:s1-p05-s08-c01:01","effective_status":"superseded_by_append_only_correction","historical_record_bytes_remain_valid":true,"published":{"current_state":"unknown_pending_additional_evidence","disposition":"carried_forward","disposition_id":"disposition:s1-p05-s08:01","immediate_owner":"S2","preserved_long_term_owner":"S2"},"rationale":"The published record kept S2 as both immediate and preserved long-term owner. Acquisition of discussion edit and deletion evidence is S2 work, but the semantics over that evidence once acquired are development-history evolution semantics owned by S5, matching every other evidence-gated remainder in this register. The immediate owner is unchanged; only the preserved long-term owner is corrected.","source":{"json_pointer":"/inherited_subject_register/items/0","path":"reference_corpus/contracts/development-history/decisions/s08-deferred-subject-disposition/decision.json","sha256":"8df7a989ef33fb5d6e70c8815d1b74748c8c2f98cfb7e581414548a403d65cfe","source_artifact":"S1.P05.S08_deferred_subject_disposition","subject_id":"gap:s05-known:discussion-edit-and-deletion-history-unknown"},"subject":"discussion edit and deletion history unknown"},{"corrected":{"current_state":"unsupported_current_scope","disposition":"split","immediate_owner":"S5","preserved_long_term_owner":"S5"},"correction_id":"correction:s1-p05-s08-c01:02","effective_status":"superseded_by_append_only_correction","historical_record_bytes_remain_valid":true,"published":{"current_state":"unsupported_current_scope","disposition":"split","disposition_id":"disposition:s1-p05-s08:03","immediate_owner":"S1.P06","preserved_long_term_owner":"S1.P06"},"rationale":"The published record routed the generic event framework to S1.P06. A generic development or repository event graph is repository and evolution graph semantics, which S5 owns; S1.P06 consumes bounded facts for FaultInstance modelling and does not own a generic event framework. The addressed portion is unchanged: S1.P05.S03 through S1.P05.S06 publish bounded typed historical occurrences and their source occurrence times without any generic framework.","source":{"json_pointer":"/inherited_subject_register/items/2","path":"reference_corpus/contracts/development-history/decisions/s08-deferred-subject-disposition/decision.json","sha256":"8df7a989ef33fb5d6e70c8815d1b74748c8c2f98cfb7e581414548a403d65cfe","source_artifact":"S1.P05.S08_deferred_subject_disposition","subject_id":"deferred:p01:p05-development-history-event-model"},"subject":"development history event model"},{"corrected":{"addressed_portion":{"addressed_by":["S1.P05.S01","S1.P05.S03","S1.P05.S04","S1.P05.S05"],"outcome":"satisfied_by_the_bounded_typed_S1_P05_relations","rationale":"S1.P05.S01 publishes the pull-request-to-revision role binding, S1.P05.S03 the review-to-revision approval, S1.P05.S04 the pull-request-to-merge-revision outcome, and S1.P05.S05 the head binding to head-ref deletion. Each is a bounded two-position typed relation over already published values.","subject":"bounded typed pull-request history relations"},"current_state":"unsupported_current_scope","disposition":"split","immediate_owner":"S5","preserved_long_term_owner":"S5"},"correction_id":"correction:s1-p05-s08-c01:03","effective_status":"superseded_by_append_only_correction","historical_record_bytes_remain_valid":true,"published":{"current_state":"unsupported_current_scope","disposition":"carried_forward","disposition_id":"disposition:s1-p05-s08:04","immediate_owner":"S1.P06","preserved_long_term_owner":"S1.P06"},"rationale":"The published record carried the whole subject forward to S1.P06 and recorded no addressed portion. That understated what S1.P05 published and misrouted the remainder. S1.P05.S01, S1.P05.S03, S1.P05.S04, and S1.P05.S05 publish bounded typed relations between a pull request and revisions, reviews, merges, and ref deletions, so an addressed portion exists and is now recorded. The generic development-history relationship and evolution graph that remains is repository-graph semantics owned by S5 rather than FaultInstance-consuming semantics owned by S1.P06.","source":{"json_pointer":"/inherited_subject_register/items/3","path":"reference_corpus/contracts/development-history/decisions/s08-deferred-subject-disposition/decision.json","sha256":"8df7a989ef33fb5d6e70c8815d1b74748c8c2f98cfb7e581414548a403d65cfe","source_artifact":"S1.P05.S08_deferred_subject_disposition","subject_id":"deferred:p01:p05-development-history-relationship-model"},"subject":"development history relationship model"},{"corrected":{"current_state":"unsupported_current_scope","disposition":"carried_forward","immediate_owner":"S5","preserved_long_term_owner":"S5"},"correction_id":"correction:s1-p05-s08-c01:04","effective_status":"superseded_by_append_only_correction","historical_record_bytes_remain_valid":true,"published":{"current_state":"unsupported_current_scope","disposition":"carried_forward","disposition_id":"disposition:s1-p05-s08:08","immediate_owner":"S1.P06","preserved_long_term_owner":"S1.P06"},"rationale":"The published record routed ancestry and reachability to S1.P06. Ancestry, descendance, reachability, branch containment, merge-base, and integration path are generic Git graph semantics over repository evidence, which S5 owns. S1.P06 may consume future ancestry facts but does not own a generic Git graph, so routing the subject there would have assigned an owner the published architecture does not support. Nothing about the non-claim changes: no published S1.P05 value expresses any of these relations, and none may be inferred from timestamps, comparison ordering, parent count, ahead or behind values, or m